    G -->|idle 120s| H
    G -->|overflow| H
    G -->|/compact| H
    G -->|none| B
    H --> I[Prune tool outputs]
    I --> J[Find cut point]
    J --> K[Summarize history]
    K --> L[Replace messages]
    L --> M[Recompute prune state]
    M --> B
